{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/016-flight-cart/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"9c55a337-80a7-5c84-8a56-f5c9ace373b9","excerpt":"Craft beer deserves a proper presentation. When hosting tastings at home, I wanted something better than a cardboard carrier. A wooden flight cart would hold…","html":"<p>Craft beer deserves a proper presentation. When hosting tastings at home, I wanted something better than a cardboard carrier. A wooden flight cart would hold eight tasting glasses and look good doing it.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/5976214a95c6239de3c907a52ca44540/493ac/holes_cut.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Holes Cut\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/5976214a95c6239de3c907a52ca44540/f058b/holes_cut.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/5976214a95c6239de3c907a52ca44540/c26ae/holes_cut.png 158w,\n/static/5976214a95c6239de3c907a52ca44540/6bdcf/holes_cut.png 315w,\n/static/5976214a95c6239de3c907a52ca44540/f058b/holes_cut.png 630w,\n/static/5976214a95c6239de3c907a52ca44540/40601/holes_cut.png 945w,\n/static/5976214a95c6239de3c907a52ca44540/78612/holes_cut.png 1260w,\n/static/5976214a95c6239de3c907a52ca44540/493ac/holes_cut.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The design started with a piece of curly maple - those shimmering waves in the grain would really pop under finish. Eight holes sized exactly to fit my tasting glasses, cut with a forstner bit on the drill press.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/27e04699e99835992a275bbbfa1c15ab/669cd/recessed.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Recessed\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/27e04699e99835992a275bbbfa1c15ab/f058b/recessed.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/27e04699e99835992a275bbbfa1c15ab/c26ae/recessed.png 158w,\n/static/27e04699e99835992a275bbbfa1c15ab/6bdcf/recessed.png 315w,\n/static/27e04699e99835992a275bbbfa1c15ab/f058b/recessed.png 630w,\n/static/27e04699e99835992a275bbbfa1c15ab/40601/recessed.png 945w,\n/static/27e04699e99835992a275bbbfa1c15ab/78612/recessed.png 1260w,\n/static/27e04699e99835992a275bbbfa1c15ab/669cd/recessed.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The top piece rides the rails of the base like an elevator.  Pick it up, and the glasses suspend in the air, held by holes in the top piece like a snifter glass.  Put it down, and the top and bottom collapse together, so you can easily pick the glass out of the lineup.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/3c9f988a0448534e004033721d4b7d79/493ac/base_assembled.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Base Assembled\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/3c9f988a0448534e004033721d4b7d79/f058b/base_assembled.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3c9f988a0448534e004033721d4b7d79/c26ae/base_assembled.png 158w,\n/static/3c9f988a0448534e004033721d4b7d79/6bdcf/base_assembled.png 315w,\n/static/3c9f988a0448534e004033721d4b7d79/f058b/base_assembled.png 630w,\n/static/3c9f988a0448534e004033721d4b7d79/40601/base_assembled.png 945w,\n/static/3c9f988a0448534e004033721d4b7d79/78612/base_assembled.png 1260w,\n/static/3c9f988a0448534e004033721d4b7d79/493ac/base_assembled.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Walnut feet elevated the board slightly, providing clearance for carrying and a nice visual contrast against the light maple. The curly figure in the maple really started to show as the finish went on.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/47d8216b986907b878b5df13d3747c87/669cd/with_handle.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"With Handle\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/47d8216b986907b878b5df13d3747c87/f058b/with_handle.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/47d8216b986907b878b5df13d3747c87/c26ae/with_handle.png 158w,\n/static/47d8216b986907b878b5df13d3747c87/6bdcf/with_handle.png 315w,\n/static/47d8216b986907b878b5df13d3747c87/f058b/with_handle.png 630w,\n/static/47d8216b986907b878b5df13d3747c87/40601/with_handle.png 945w,\n/static/47d8216b986907b878b5df13d3747c87/78612/with_handle.png 1260w,\n/static/47d8216b986907b878b5df13d3747c87/669cd/with_handle.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The handle was shaped from walnut to match the feet. A comfortable grip was essential - this thing would be carried while full of beer. The spokeshave got a good workout shaping those curves.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2876d80986dc8438ba7f66046750e639/493ac/in_use.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"In Use\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/2876d80986dc8438ba7f66046750e639/f058b/in_use.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/2876d80986dc8438ba7f66046750e639/c26ae/in_use.png 158w,\n/static/2876d80986dc8438ba7f66046750e639/6bdcf/in_use.png 315w,\n/static/2876d80986dc8438ba7f66046750e639/f058b/in_use.png 630w,\n/static/2876d80986dc8438ba7f66046750e639/40601/in_use.png 945w,\n/static/2876d80986dc8438ba7f66046750e639/78612/in_use.png 1260w,\n/static/2876d80986dc8438ba7f66046750e639/493ac/in_use.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The finished flight cart in action, loaded up with a variety from dark stouts. The curly maple catches the light beautifully, and the walnut accents tie it all together.</p>\n<p>Projects like this are why I got into woodworking - something functional, something beautiful, and something that makes everyday moments a little more special.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Flight Cart","date":"November 17, 2018","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/015-wood-cookies/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Wood Cookies"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/017-stereo-cozy/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Stereo Cozy"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"9c55a337-80a7-5c84-8a56-f5c9ace373b9","previousPostId":"05ecc232-b3d2-5899-b93e-89ffecb9e146","nextPostId":"572477e9-0945-5561-998b-68e11459c114"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}